NAME
    write - write one byte to memory

SYNOPSIS
    write <space> <addr> <value>

DESCRIPTION
    Writes a single byte to <space> at <addr>. Refuses outright if <space>
    isn't writable (see 'spaces'). No pause/synchronization with the
    emulation thread beyond whatever the current frontend provides (see the
    'pause'/'resume' commands in EmuSen.Mistress's console window).

EXAMPLES
    write WRAM 10 ff
